{"strongs": "H5402", "word": "נֶ֫שֶׁק", "translit": "ne.sheq", "root": "נשק", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "equipment, weapons", "definition": "נֶ֫שֶׁק , נֵ֫שֶׁק noun [masculine] equipment, weapons (collective) armoury ; — absolute נֶ֫שֶׁק Ezek 39:9 + 2 t., נֵ֫שֶׁק 1Kgs 10:25 ; 2Chr 9:24 , נָָֽשֶׁק 2Kgs 10:2 + 2 t., construct ׳ נֶ Isa 22:8 , ׳ נֵ Job 20:24 — 1. equipment, weapons 1Kgs 10:25 ; 2Kgs 10:2 ; Isa 22:8 ; 2Chr 9:24 ; Ezek 39:9 (general term, followed by specific), v Ezek 39:10 בַרְזֶל ׳ נ Job 20:24 ( קֶשֶׁת נְחשֶׁת ); יוֺם נָָֽשֶׁק Ps 140:8 i.e. day of battle; so ׳ נ alone Job 39:21 . 2. apparently armoury Neh 3:19 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5430')\">BDB5430</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5402')\">H5402</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5429')\">BDB5429</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5431')\">BDB5431</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נֶ֫שֶׁק</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נֵ֫שֶׁק</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>equipment, weapons</highlightword> (collective) <highlightword>armoury</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>נֶ֫שֶׁק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,9)\">Ezek 39:9</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>נֵ֫שֶׁק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:25\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,25)\">1Kgs 10:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:24\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,24)\">2Chr 9:24</ref>, <bdbheb>נָָֽשֶׁק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,2)\">2Kgs 10:2</ref> + 2 t., construct <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,8)\">Isa 22:8</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֵ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 20:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd